    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, your Guardian Spirit offers you <b>Vital Encouragement</b>, urging you to press on despite adversity. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to 10 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> first, and any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> from multiple sources do not stack.",
